  "slug": "television-james-paul-mccartney-7",
  "title": "Television: James Paul McCartney | 1973",
  "date": "1973-03-18",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Filming for the television special <em>James Paul McCartney</em> continued on 18 March 1973 at Elstree Studios. <span id=\"more-133405\"></span></p><p><a href=\"/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_05/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-133385\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iODEwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDgxMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"133385\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_05/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_05.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1600,1621\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_05-948x960.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_05-948x960.jpg\" alt=\"James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" width=\"800\" height=\"810\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-133385\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_05-948x960.jpg 948w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_05-572x580.jpg 572w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_05-197x200.jpg 197w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_05-768x778.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_05-1516x1536.jpg 1516w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_05.jpg 1600w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>This was the only day of filming to feature all the members of Wings. They had taken part in two days of rehearsals in February and March, but the rest of the filming featured only <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul</a> and <a href=\"/people/linda-mccartney/\">Linda McCartney</a>.</p><p>The day was spent filming a concert sequence. On 8 March a letter had been sent to members of the Wings Fun Club, inviting them to apply for free tickets for the concert.</p><p>The show began at 7.45pm. The set included <a href=\"/songs/the-long-and-winding-road/\">‘The Long And Winding Road’</a>, <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/songs/maybe-im-amazed/\">‘Maybe I’m Amazed’</a>, <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/songs/when-the-night/\">‘When The Night’</a>, ‘The Mess’, <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/songs/wild-life/\">‘Wild Life’</a>, <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/songs/go-now/\">‘Go Now’</a>, <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/songs/hi-hi-hi/\">‘Hi, Hi, Hi’</a>, and <a href=\"/songs/long-tall-sally/\">‘Long Tall Sally’</a>.</p><p>Due to technical issues, Wings performed two sets. The second ended at 10pm, and included two versions of ‘Hi, Hi, Hi’, but omitted ‘Long Tall Sally’.</p><p>Produced by ATV, <em>James Paul McCartney</em> was first broadcast on 16 April 1973 in the USA, and 10 May in the UK. It was released on DVD as part of the super deluxe reissue of in <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/albums/red-rose-speedway/\"><em>Red Rose Speedway</em></a> December 2018.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1973/03/18/television-james-paul-mccartney-7/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-133405 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-580x577.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-960x955.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-768x764.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-1536x1528.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02.jpg 1600w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"133382\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1600,1592\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_02-960x955.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"136\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_03-200x136.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbib